<section | Inline math in top-level prose>
The Pythagorean theorem states that $a^2 + b^2 = c^2$ for right triangles.

This is the same equation authored as a sigil tag: <$ a^2 + b^2 = c^2 $>.

<section | Bare math inside named-tag content>

<aside | Consider the Einstein equation $E = mc^2$ which relates energy and mass.>

The same aside with authored shorthand: <aside | Consider the equation <$ E = mc^2 $>.>

<section | Display math in top-level prose>

